# 從頭再嚟
(pos:短語)
<explanation>
yue:由#開始 嗰個位置開始，重新#做 一次（量詞：個）
eng:to start over; to begin again from the beginning
<eg>
yue:呢個遊戲玩壞咗，我哋從頭再嚟啦。 (nei5 go3 ho1 ji2 waan6 waai2 le5, ngo5 dai6 cong4 tou4 zoi6 lai4 laa1.)
eng:That game got broken, let's start over.

yue:呢個方案唔好，我哋從頭再嚟計。 (nei5 go3 fong1 aan6 m4 hou2, ngo5 dai6 cong4 tou4 zoi6 lai4 gai3.)
eng:That plan doesn't work, let's start over and think about it. [end of text]


